to":"2韩严遂弑哀侯，国人立其子懿侯。初，哀侯以韩廆为相而爱严遂，二人甚相害也。严遂令人刺韩廆于朝，廆走哀侯，哀侯抱之；人刺韩廆，兼及哀侯。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":101,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c0b1b1f-db0e-11ef-8c30-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-370,"link_td_description":"魏武侯，中国战国时魏国君主，姬姓，魏氏，名击。前396年继魏文侯位，前370年卒。","link_td_id":"Q10001005","link_td_number_id":265362,"people_name":"魏武侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏武侯","people_xingming":"击","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c0b1b65-db0e-11ef-9c63-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-400,"link_death_year":-319,"link_td_description":"魏惠王，本名魏罃，一作魏婴，魏武侯之子，生于魏文侯二十五年（前400年），全谥为魏文惠王或魏惠成王，通称魏惠王，战国时期魏国的第三代君主，在位期间为前370年－前319年。原本为侯，五国相王后称王，在位时期魏国由盛至衰。《孟子》一书中又称其为梁惠王，《庄子》中称文惠君。","link_td_id":"Q10000501","link_td_number_id":334595,"people_name":"罃","people_name_jianti_auto":"䓨","people_xingming":"罃","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8c0b1b66-db0e-11ef-ad5e-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"魏缓，即公子缓（《史记》作公中缓，今从《竹书纪年》），魏武侯之子。","link_td_id":"Q10001652","link_td_number_id":488945,"people_name":"公中緩","people_name_jianti_auto":"公中缓","people_xingming":"缓","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8c0b1b67-db0e-11ef-ad42-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"浊泽之战","tongjian_id":"war_N0506"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["权争"],"content":"3魏武侯薨，不立太子，子罃與公中緩爭立，國內亂。","content_fanyi":"魏武侯去世，因为没有立太子，他的儿子魏罃与公中缓争夺国君之位，国内发生动乱。","content_jianti_auto":"3魏武侯薨，不立太子，子䓨与公中缓争立，国内乱。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":102,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8c0b1b63-db0e-11ef-8202-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"五年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"五年","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8c08f89f-db0e-11ef-a9b0-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（庚戌、前三七一）","year_int":-371},"message":"success","success":true}